<ul>
<li><b>Set lists, several slots at once:</b>
<ul>
<li>select several slots and change their <b>color, font size, volume or transpose</b> together, from the panel on the right (one Undo each);
</li>
<li><b>drag</b> a slot, or several selected ones, to reorder them: the other slots <b>make room as you go</b>, like icons on a phone, and dropping keeps that order.
</li></ul>
</li>
<li><b>Two set lists:</b> a new button next to Sort shows another set list next to the one you're editing. Drag slots between them to <b>copy</b> them: they go in where you drop them and the following ones move down.
</li>
<li><b>Go to Combi / Go to Program:</b> right-click a set list slot to jump to the sound it plays and edit it.
</li></ul>]]></description>
