            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:12px}h1,h2{font-size:15px}</style><h2>Kaiju 0.9.17 beta</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Welcome:</b> a <b>Welcome</b> row at the top of the sidebar goes back to the welcome screen (recent files, Import, New blank PCG…) without closing your PCGs; clicking a PCG returns to it on the same tab.
</li>
<li><b>Clearer wording:</b>
<ul>
<li>moving a sound to a bank of the other type now says <b>Incompatible Bank Type</b> and how to fix it;
</li>
<li>the panel for several selected slots: <b>Copy (⌘C)</b>, <b>Cut to Move (⌘X)</b>, <b>Initialize (⌫)</b>, what each one does, and the selection shortcuts;
</li>
<li>right-click menus say <b>Cut to Move</b>;
</li>
<li>changing a bank's type (HD-1 / EXi) says that it initializes all the programs in the bank, and that ⌘Z undoes it.
</li></ul>
</li>
<li>While a PCG loads, the mascot shows centered (for a moment it appeared stuck at the left).
</li></ul>]]></description>
